# MovieBook — Project Documentation

## 1. Overview

MovieBook is a full-stack movie ticket booking web application. Users browse movies, choose a showtime and city, select seats on an interactive seat map, pay online (Razorpay) or at the theater, and receive their booking confirmation by email and SMS with a downloadable PDF ticket. Admin users can manage movie posters and add new theaters.

