## 12. Known Limitations

- Admin accounts are created by a backend script, not through the UI — intentional, to keep admin grants deliberate. The demo admin credentials are published in this document, so remove or change that account after the project has been reviewed.
- Resend's free sandbox can only email the address you signed up with on Resend, until a custom domain is verified.
- Twilio's trial tier can only SMS verified numbers.
- Render's free tier sleeps after 15 minutes of inactivity; the first request after idle time may take 30-60 seconds.
- Seat layout is fixed at 12×12 per screen.
